  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6789aed8832a535459d3a801ae4a9053, type: 3}
  mouthShouldMove: 00000000000000000000
  subtitles:
  - 
  - '[Lance] I grew up in a small town in northern Canada.'
  - "[Lance] People like to pretend energy poverty only exists far away\u2026 but
    I\u2019ve seen it at home too."
  - "[Lance] Our infrastructure was flimsy and blackouts weren\u2019t uncommon"
  - '[Lance] When the power went out, everything stopped. Schools. Hospitals. Communication.
    Hope.'
  - "[Lance] That\u2019s when I realized\u2026 energy isn\u2019t just electricity."
  - "[Lance] It\u2019s dignity. It\u2019s opportunity. It\u2019s survival."
  - '[Lance] Canada has the resources. The research. The engineers.'
  - "[Lance] We just don\u2019t always send that power where it\u2019s needed most."
  - "[Lance] I promised myself\u2026 if I ever got the chance, I\u2019d change that."
